            "text": "As of June 27, 2026 and September 27, 2025, the Company had outstanding fixed-rate notes with varying maturities for an aggregate carrying amount of $82.3 billion and $90.7 billion, respectively (collectively the “Notes”). As of June 27, 2026 and September 27, 2025, the fair value of the Company’s Notes, based on Level 2 inputs, was $71.2 billion and $80.4 billion, respectively."
